Hello,

I think geom_linerange will do what you want.

pi.plot <- qplot(x=position, ymin = 0, ymax = fst , data = final.res, geom = "linerange",

group = chrom, colour = col, xlab = "chromosome", ylab = "SNP density (snps/10k)") + facet_grid(chrom ~., scales = "free_x")
(pi.plot)

Cheers,
-Jonathan

