It is not working for the reason stated in the error message.

time[conc==max(conc, na.rm=T)]

says "give me the values of time from the rows where conc is equal to
the maximum value of conc". It turns out that there are three such
rows, but there are thirteen rows in the subset defined by unique
values of Subject. This basic problem can be illustrated by

dat.tmp <- data.frame(x = 1:13)
cbind(dat.tmp, 1:3)

The implication is that you need to re-think conceptually what it is
you're trying to do.

