hi,

use geom_path instead of geom_line:

ggplot(egavg, aes(x=temp, y=depth.cat <http://depth.cat>)) +
 geom_path(aes(colour=site)) +

 geom_point(aes(group=site, colour=site, shape=site)) +
 scale_y_reverse()

