Hi Ram,
While it's certainly possible to use position_dodge for this, it is
probably easier to just do it "by hand". Try something like

ggplot() + geom_point(data = datag, aes(x = X1, y = X2), shape = 1,
alpha = 1) +

        geom_text(data = datag, aes(x = X1 -2, y = X2, lab = names),
size = 2.5, colour = 'red') + geom_text(data = datag, aes(x = X1-1, y =

X2, lab = X2), size = 2.5, colour = 'green4') + theme_bw()

Best,
Ista

